From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fuchen <fuchen@oneiric.local>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:19:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Oneiric: gate ServerTickStart/End to once per tick (fixes
 spark/ClearLag TPS buffer overflow under Folia region concurrency)


